# Commit messages MUST be ASCII-only (Cloudflare Pages requirement).
# Use English. No Thai, arrows (->  not →), em dashes (-- not —), or symbols.
#
# Good: "Add avatar dropdown with logout to sidebar"
# Good: "Fix receipt price truncation for orders over 100k LAK"
# Bad:  "เพิ่ม feature ใหม่"
# Bad:  "qty_required → qty_normal rename"
